g class."] [330 1 "// ucdCategory is the general category's name."] [333 1 "// ucdOld is the 3.2.0 database's change record of a code point (get_change_3_2_0)."] [356 1 "// ucdDB is a database: the current one (old false) or 3.2.0's."] [389 1 "// decompRecord is get_decomp_record: the decomposition's first index, prefix and count."] [406 1 "// nfdNfkd is nfd_nfkd: the canonical (k: compatibility) decomposition, canonically ordered."] [441 2 "// each run of combining characters sorted by combining class, stably"] [492 1 "// nfcNfkc is nfc_nfkc: the decomposition, then the canonical composition."] [572 1 "// quickcheck is is_normalized_quickcheck: 0 yes, 1 maybe, 2 no."] [634 1 "// Normalize is unicodedata.normalize(form, s) of the current database."] [727 1 "// lookupDawg is _lookup_dawg_packed: the name's position, -1 when none."] [782 1 "// inverseDawg is _inverse_dawg_lookup: the name at a position."] [821 1 "// ucdName is _getucname: the code point's name (with aliases and named sequences when withSeq)."] [840 3 "// 3.15's _getucname: every derived prefix (Tangut, CJK compatibility, Egyptian, Khitan, Nushu; queue 237), 3.14's"] [841 3 "// only the CJK unified ideographs"] [892 1 "// ucdGetCode is _getcode: the code point of a name (aliases and named sequences as their PUA code points)."] [927 1 "// ucdLookupName is the \\N{...} escape's lookup (capi_getcode with named sequences refused): the code point."] [942 1 "// ucdCharName is the namereplace handler's name (capi_getucname without aliases)."] [968 1 "// ucdChr is the functions' chr argument: a str of one character."] [999 1 "// ucdFunctions is unicodedata_functions over a database: the module's functions and UCD's methods."] [1212 1 "// isASCIIOrUTF8 is true when the str has no lone surrogate (its text valid UTF-8)."] [1258 4 "// 3.15's isxidstart and isxidcontinue (unicodedata.c, _PyUnicode_IsXidStart and _PyUnicode_IsXidContinue over"] [1259 4 "// the ctype records' flags; queue 237): module functions, not 